WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.178
Today we will reuse materials while arranging an image. Our work connects with

00:00:05.178 --> 00:00:07.859
international artists and communities around the world.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:12.263
Sort clean paper by colour and select pieces for your picture.

00:00:13.117 --> 00:00:15.997
Arrange pieces on cardboard before applying glue.

00:00:17.117 --> 00:00:22.227
Stick the pieces down and explain the main image. Justify a revision using evidence

00:00:22.227 --> 00:00:23.687
from another world tradition.
